"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5388010","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4365230","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:03Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4365230,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4365230","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:03Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4365230,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4365230","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:03Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4365230,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1847286114034959","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"A tripling of wishlists?! THANK YOU for 1,000 wishlists!!!!!","summary":"HOLY! A TRIPLING OF WISHLISTS!! WE HIT 1,000!! Hey you awesome people!! Over the last few days I've had the privilege of having people wishlist, play, and then volunteer feedback (both good and the critical, both of which we LOVE!), watching streamers play it (which is GREAT because chat hops on and FLAMES the game, which is hilarious and great learning points and a good time for everyone). In general the whacky tone seems to be a hit (balanced out by the somber bits haha) And despite the doom a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:28:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034959","verified_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1846651706689198","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"Gee, Next Fest, Eh, Seven? DEMO LIVESTREAM with the developer!","summary":"EMOTIONAL DAMAGE!! That's what Dad did to you as a kid. And now, one fateful night, you, the black sheep of the family, suddenly has to avenge all their demises because a rival boba gang took them out! Build your first shop, then the next, unlocking more pieces of the puzzle.. Or just spend your whole day making the sickest boba tea, I'm not your father! DEMO OUT AND AVAILABLE FOR ROASTING. Roast me harder - I can take it! I'll make this game something you will be proud to be a part of >:) (P.S.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:07:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689198","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1846651706683341","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"350 wishlists! MASSIVE progress and a world you will want to chill in","summary":"If you're reading this - you are already a special type of person, and you can make the difference! The demo for Gee, Tea, Eh, Seven? is LIVE, with more than 60 added features ːsteamhappyː since the last post!! I've been REALLY busy, I'm just bad at marketing (or rather, I want to keep building for you, instead of shouting about it >","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:58:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1832065502821785","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"100 wishlist CELEBRATION: PRE-ALPHA TRAILER!","summary":"Hi everyone, I wish there was a way to contact you all. You have to know you're really special - I've been pushing myself to work on this project as close to 7 days a week as possible, some days up to 18-20 hours of non-stop pushing. And why is that? It's because somehow twenty, then fifty, then 100 gamers decided to take a chance on this unknown, first-time developer. I have not really held up my end of the bargain on keeping you guys in the loop, and I'm truly sorry. I keep running my head int","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T16:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502821785","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1825727806719184","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"50 wishlists?! D: Okay okay, I'll show development progress!","summary":"Hey everyone! Somehow we managed to accrue 50 wishlists! You guys are incredible. Giving up was never a thought in my head (I'm an obsessive person) but you guys being on the list makes me RABID about pushing harder, iterating faster, devving more, and generally putting me into overdrive so we can ship this project on time >:D I feel like an injustice has been done to most of you seeing as the Steam page is literally EMPTY screenshots with no sense of sound, the world, the setting or the peds as","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-03T04:53:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806719184","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4365230-1823825466504354","game_id":"steam-4365230","kind":"announcement","title":"Our first 20 wishlists! Thank you, you awesome few.","summary":"If you're seeing this - WOW. You're OG. Welcome to the first 20 wishlisters. I am absolutely floored, and thank you for discovering this page and deeming it worthy of your W/L! I haven't even started publishing on socials yet so you guys are truly truly OG and connoisseurs :D I wanted to give you guys some sign of life because - well, I'm working solo, so updates may not be terribly constant as I'm likely working on code, sound design, with composers, designers, trying to wrap my head around som","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-09T02:36:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466504354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4365230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4365230":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4365230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z"},"5388010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4365230","app_id